window.__code__["runtime-phases-py"] = {"code_id": "runtime-phases-py", "kind": "src", "title": "phases.py", "source_path": "QwenPaw-main/src/qwenpaw/runtime/phases.py", "highlight_line": null, "code_html": "<div class=\"code-body\">\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"1\"><span class=\"c-no\">1</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-com\"># -*- coding: utf-8 -*-</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"2\"><span class=\"c-no\">2</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Runtime hook phase enum.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"3\"><span class=\"c-no\">3</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"4\"><span class=\"c-no\">4</span><span class=\"c-src\">Eight phase points covering the full request lifecycle::</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"5\"><span class=\"c-no\">5</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"6\"><span class=\"c-no\">6</span><span class=\"c-src\">    PRE_DISPATCH      — request normalization, before slash dispatch</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"7\"><span class=\"c-no\">7</span><span class=\"c-src\">    POST_DISPATCH     — slash dispatch finished without a match</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"8\"><span class=\"c-no\">8</span><span class=\"c-src\">    PRE_AGENT_BUILD   — session.load <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> other pre-build setup</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"9\"><span class=\"c-no\">9</span><span class=\"c-src\">    POST_AGENT_BUILD  — agent constructed; inject mode context</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"10\"><span class=\"c-no\">10</span><span class=\"c-src\">    PRE_EXECUTE       — bootstrap / prompt refresh / env stack push</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"11\"><span class=\"c-no\">11</span><span class=\"c-src\">    POST_RESPONSE     — session.save / cron trigger writeback</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"12\"><span class=\"c-no\">12</span><span class=\"c-src\">    ON_ERROR          — exception normalization, cancel envelope</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"13\"><span class=\"c-no\">13</span><span class=\"c-src\">    FINALLY           — idempotent cleanup (close mcp, reset ContextVars)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"14\"><span class=\"c-no\">14</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"15\"><span class=\"c-no\">15</span><span class=\"c-src\">Phase points are fixed; the slash-command registry <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> ``AgentBuilder.build``</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"16\"><span class=\"c-no\">16</span><span class=\"c-src\">sit between phases <span class=\"c-kw\">as</span> fixed steps <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> are <span class=\"c-kw\">not</span> themselves hooks.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"17\"><span class=\"c-no\">17</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"18\"><span class=\"c-no\">18</span><span class=\"c-src\">These hooks are the runtime-orchestration layer, distinct <span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> the</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"19\"><span class=\"c-no\">19</span><span class=\"c-src\">``agentscope.middleware`` middlewares that wrap a single agent&<span class=\"c-com\">#x27;s reply</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"20\"><span class=\"c-no\">20</span><span class=\"c-src\">loop. The two are orthogonal.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"21\"><span class=\"c-no\">21</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"22\"><span class=\"c-no\">22</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"23\"><span class=\"c-no\">23</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> __future__ <span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> annotations</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"24\"><span class=\"c-no\">24</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"25\"><span class=\"c-no\">25</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> enum <span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> Enum</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"26\"><span class=\"c-no\">26</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"27\"><span class=\"c-no\">27</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"28\"><span class=\"c-no\">28</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">class</span> Phase(str, Enum):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"29\"><span class=\"c-no\">29</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span><span class=\"c-str\">&quot;Eight phase points around a single ``Runtime.run()`` invocation.&quot;</span><span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"30\"><span class=\"c-no\">30</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"31\"><span class=\"c-no\">31</span><span class=\"c-src\">    PRE_DISPATCH = <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;pre_dispatch&quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"32\"><span class=\"c-no\">32</span><span class=\"c-src\">    POST_DISPATCH = <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;post_dispatch&quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"33\"><span class=\"c-no\">33</span><span class=\"c-src\">    PRE_AGENT_BUILD = <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;pre_agent_build&quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"34\"><span class=\"c-no\">34</span><span class=\"c-src\">    POST_AGENT_BUILD = <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;post_agent_build&quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"35\"><span class=\"c-no\">35</span><span class=\"c-src\">    PRE_EXECUTE = <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;pre_execute&quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"36\"><span class=\"c-no\">36</span><span class=\"c-src\">    POST_RESPONSE = <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;post_response&quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"37\"><span class=\"c-no\">37</span><span class=\"c-src\">    ON_ERROR = <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;on_error&quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"38\"><span class=\"c-no\">38</span><span class=\"c-src\">    FINALLY = <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;finally&quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"39\"><span class=\"c-no\">39</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"40\"><span class=\"c-no\">40</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"41\"><span class=\"c-no\">41</span><span class=\"c-src\">__all__ = [<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;Phase&quot;</span>]</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"42\"><span class=\"c-no\">42</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n</div>", "lines": 42, "explanation": "phases.py 来自 agentscope/QwenPaw 框架源码。结合左侧源码与右侧知识点理解此处设计意图；点「反向链接」可回到引用它的教程章节。", "knowledge_points": [], "related_docs": ["qwenpaw-改造清单"]};
